  body: "# Regular occupation for REA\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nFor REA, the source describes regular occupation
    as the trade, profession or type of work actually followed, usually assessed at accident or disease-onset date,
    rather than one job with one employer.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThe source includes gainful-occupation,
    multiple-occupation, recent-change and progression qualifications. The relevant date is a claimant-event date,
    not a publication date. No occupational capacity or hypothetical wage is decided.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\
    \n- [DMG 71041, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=11).\n\
    - [DMG 71044, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=11).\n\
    - [DMG 71045, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=11).\n\
    - [DMG 71052, PDF page 12](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=12).\n\
    - [DMG 71054, PDF page 12](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=12).\n\
    - [DMG 71055, PDF page 12](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=12).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol11-ch71`:
    PDF `e001c101fb7be9bc739a8a5b9c1281637a93f34a099658e7dafef6fbb2b5d4f5`; extracted pages `1414e514cf78c7a2e0a3ce66e2d88727d3fda28f764fd2e8654361dc569356d6`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:34.428591Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d11f8c6e5274a065e721738/dmgch71.pdf#page=11
