    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: The source explicitly relates identification of the regular occupation to loss of earning
      power.
    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol11-ch71/0012
      quote: "71052   REA is related to loss of earning power, so that a claimant’s regular occupation\n       \
        \ need not be\n\n        1.    employed earner’s employment or\n\n        2.    confined to the work actually
        being done at the time of an accident1.\n\n        The regular occupation must however be a gainful occupation.
        Unpaid work should\n        be ignored2.\n                                                             \
        \          1 R(I) 15/56; 2 CI 441/50(KL)"
      locator: DMG 71052
